# Maintenance Guidelines

## Regular Tasks
- Update dependencies monthly
- Review and update documentation quarterly
- Test on new macOS versions when released
- Monitor for user feedback
- Keep MCPs updated

## Code Quality
- Refactor when needed
- Remove dead code
- Keep dependencies minimal
- Update Swift version when stable
- Follow Apple's deprecation warnings

## Emergency Procedures

### If Hotkey Stops Working
1. Check permission status
2. Verify hotkey registration
3. Check for conflicts
4. Provide fallback activation method

### If Screen Capture Fails
1. Check Screen Recording permission
2. Verify display configuration
3. Handle errors gracefully
4. Provide user guidance

### If App Crashes
1. Check error logs
2. Identify root cause
3. Fix immediately
4. Test thoroughly before release
